  epo:hasAdditionalInformation "This prior information notice announces the intention of the contracting authority to publish a future call for tenders. No other information or documents are available at this stage. Interested economic operators are invited to subscribe at the link https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/tender-details/210e2a33-1a7d-4793-8135-75684bfa74d5-PIN in order to get notified when the contract notice and all the procurement documents, including the tender specifications, are published."@en;
